            "review_title": "Review at Khai Tâm Vegetarian",
            "review_text": "Road26501115357\n1 contribution\n0\nAmazing place for vegans and vegetarians\nNov 2025 • Solo\nAmazing place for vegans and vegetarians!\nExept the Curry, everything on the menu is actually vegan. \nThe food IS traditional, Home Made and especially made with truck loads of Love. \nThe Restaurant ist run by a lovely local mother+daughter couple, they are bothe such big Hearts!\nThe prices are very affordable (40k in average in the Moment) for a whole meal.\nI have been eating there now for 5 days in a row, because I Love it so much.\nAlso, there is a picture of each dish within the menu :).\nRead more\nWritten November 4, 2025",
